### 1. Metadados do serviço
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/diagnostico/modelo
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Accept: application/json

### 2. Predição - passageira da primeira classe
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pclass": 1,
  "sex": "female",
  "age": 35,
  "sib_sp": 1,
  "parch": 0,
  "fare": 53.1,
  "embarked": "S"
}

### 3. Predição - passageiro da terceira classe
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pclass": 3,
  "sex": "male",
  "age": 22,
  "sib_sp": 0,
  "parch": 0,
  "fare": 7.25,
  "embarked": "S"
}

### 4. Entrada inválida - idade deve ser numérica
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pclass": 1,
  "sex": "female",
  "age": "invalido",
  "sib_sp": 1,
  "parch": 0,
  "fare": 53.1,
  "embarked": "S"
}